OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mixture of sunshine and
OL,6,Fshowers on Wednesday, these most
OL,7,Ffrequent in the morning before easing
OL,8,Ffrom the west. Turning gradually
OL,9,Fcloudier from the west into the
OL,10,Fevening. Temperatures around average
OL,11,Fwith light winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloud thickens and lowers
OL,14,Ffrom the west with outbreaks of rain
OL,15,Ffollowing, possibly locally heavy
OL,16,Fthrough the early hours. Turning
OL,17,Fbreezy and remaining mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
