OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FEarly cloud and rain clear
OL,6,Fto the southeast with a mostly dry day
OL,7,Fwith plenty of sunny spells then
OL,8,Ffollowing. The odd shower possible
OL,9,Ftowards the northwest.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FFurther
OL,12,Fwet weather arriving by the afternoon
OL,13,Fon Friday. Mostly cloudy on Saturday
OL,14,Fand Sunday with patchy rain and
OL,15,Fstronger winds. Brighter to the east
OL,16,Fof high ground.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
